  "decisions": [
    "Keep the existing Zot registry and persistent store; do not introduce Harbor or another registry.",
    "Promote Zot configuration and lifecycle ownership from an expired Runtime workspace to Artifact-v2 source control plus rootful Podman Quadlet/systemd materialization.",
    "Keep exact digest-pinned Zot v2.1.20 until a deliberate upgrade is separately admitted.",
    "Keep host networking only because this WSL substrate cannot create the default netavark bridge; constrain exposure with Zot address 127.0.0.1:5080.",
    "Keep the provenance-locked Cosign 3.1.3 verifier; ambient /usr/bin/cosign is not selected authority.",
    "Graduate standardized public-key Sigstore bundle verification only; keep keyless identity/tlog release trust ungraduated."
